0:["zmEFA7V4niAwXGr7KNBhH",[[["",{"children":["gameshow-host",{"children":["__PAGE__",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["gameshow-host",{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",["$","main",null,{"className":"inner-page","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h1>Now time for the... <span class=\"ident\">Gameshow</span> voice!</h1>\r\n<p>Looking for that over the top Gameshow Host voice? Got an event that needs some cheese?<br>\r\nGuy delivers both a great UK and USA version of this cheesy style.</p>"}}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-bar"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-parallax","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>THIS MORNING <span class=\"ident\">Spin to Win Gameshow</span> voice<h2>\r\n<p>Guy is heard frequently on ITV's flagship mid morning magazine show with Phil and Holly. The voice of the huge prizes when the celebrities are not voicing them.<br>\r\nThen comes Spin to Win! Guy,  you got a gameshow voice? Err, Yeah!<br>This is where Phil and Holly spin the wheel and should it land on a holiday, thats when you'll hear that cheesy Gameshow Voice style.\r\n<p>Some of the other exciting projects included an American gameshow voice promo on BBC Radio 1 for <a  class=\"ident\" title=\"Headcam Day Promo - BBC Radio 1\" href=\"https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/gameshow-usa\" target=\"_blank\">Headcam day</a> too.</p>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lMgRXetDlKU","title":"YouTube video","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"inner-row reverse","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/B3FiqvXTeX8","title":"YouTube video","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Need a Robot <span class=\"ident\">Gameshow</span> voice?</h2>\r\n<p>On a trip to Hollywood we visited the Guinness Book of Records Museum, and heard my voice on the Robot in the new Trivia Quiz attraction.<br>\r\nIf you ever find yourself on Hollywood Blvd, do pop in and play.<br>\r\nThere is never a dull moment in voiceover and it's always exciting to see what job enquiries come in. I have to say, the Quiz Show Host Voice is one of my favourites.<br>\r\nSo, if you want that Cheesy Game Show Voice, do get in touch.</p>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><h2><span class=\"ident\">Time for a </span>Quiz</h2>\r\n<p>Question 1. How do you get your Gameshow Host voice?<br>\r\nQuestion 2. Will it cost a lot of money?<br>\r\nQuestion 3. How long will it take?<br>\r\nAnswers. <p>\r\n1 Get in touch. \r\n<br>2 Probably not.\r\n<br>3 A same day service.<br>\r\nLet me bring your quiz to life. Let me enhance a corporate event with a quiz show voice that will rouse a smile or 2.<br>\r\nClick <a href=\"contact-guy\" class=\"isred\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"the contact page\">the contact page</a> to get in touch.</p>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"cl